{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>黃仁勳重新執掌英偉達，距離他因被曝與一名直屬下屬及一名女性有婚外情而辭去行政總裁職務，還不到兩周。</strong>黃仁勳於11月12日離開公司。本周一，在與黃仁勳進行磋商並受到美國總統當勞·特朗普施壓後，英偉達董事會一致決定恢復其職務。短短11天內峰迴路轉，使這成為知名企業行政總裁最快復出案例之一。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587770.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:23:52.387297+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:56:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_hash":"c247f058d0f849a9a83b897091a5673966ebb3aa3b134cf6371e0ace46adbff8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}